expression: help
---
Delete a project record by ID

Usage: rslbp project delete [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>
          Project identifier to delete

Options:
      --dry-run
          Preview deletion without calling the remote API

  -y, --yes
          Confirm deletion non-interactively without prompting

  -h, --help
          Print help
